==Description==
'''VIP Boost''' is a [[Modifiers|modifier]] that boosts {{Exp|}} gained by 25% on every map if the player has the VIP [[Gamepasses|gamepass]].

==Effects==
When active, '''VIP Boost''' will increase {{Exp|}} by 25%. This only applies to matches, it cannot increase rewards from other sources, such as [[Quests]]. Uniquely, this boost is not additive with other modifiers. It is only additive with the [[XP Boost]] modifier. Because of this, if upon triumphing you would receive {{Exp|100}}, the '''VIP Boost''' and [[XP Boost]] modifiers together would increase it to {{Exp|175}}, though the '''VIP Boost''' and the [[Mutation]] modifier would increase it to {{Exp|150}}. This is caused by the former being calculated as ''{{Exp|100}} × (1.5 + 1.25)'', while the latter is calculated as ''{{Exp|100}} × 1.25 × 1.2''.

